WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
This is the Advanced Detection war room. It turns an early warning into a decision, while there is still time to act. What follows is a simulated incident.

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Off-gas sensors in Battery Hall B are in alarm on two of six zones. The operator loads the event report.

3
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Six engines assess it. This is a warning before thermal runaway, with escalation projected in forty-five to ninety minutes. Exposure runs from one point two to two point four million dollars. The risk score is seventy-four out of one hundred.

4
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:55.000
The Operations Strategist receives the case in one click, with the analysis intact, and the exposure projected both ways.

5
00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:10.000
The Executive Portal shows the decision: isolate racks four through six in Hall B within one hour, for twenty-five thousand dollars. The system recommends. The site safety lead decides.

